# Check Skills Before Answering

- Before answering a prompt, review the available skills (in agent_skills or .cursor/skills, .agents/skills).
- If a skill's description matches the task, read and apply it.
- Use vercel-react-best-practices for React/Next.js performance, bundle, re-render, or server-side work.
- Use vercel-composition-patterns for compound components, boolean prop proliferation, or composition.
- Use web-design-guidelines for UI review, accessibility, or design audits.
